cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "E-HRIP Explainable Claim-Flagging Methods"
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
abstract: >-
  Transparent methods that flag healthcare claims and providers for human review and state the reason
  for every flag. Includes claim-level rules tested on CMS synthetic Medicare claims, a provider-level
  peer comparison run on CMS's public 2023 Medicare Physician and Other Practitioners data and checked
  against the HHS-OIG List of Excluded Individuals/Entities, and a comparison with common approaches.
  Full run records are included.
keywords:
  - payment integrity
  - Medicare
  - Medicaid
  - improper payments
  - explainable methods
  - healthcare claims
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pan-der-02/ehrip-methods"
authors:
